{"id":"661726","name":"干炸大虾","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661726/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"新鲜活虾","amount":"10～20只"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜大虾。","img":"images/661726/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"处理干净去虾头虾线须子。","img":"images/661726/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"控干水份。","img":"images/661726/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"开背，加盐和白胡椒粉。腌2小时以上，这样炸货会入味。","img":"images/661726/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"厨房纸吸掉多余水。","img":"images/661726/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"油加热，八成热，油有点冒烟后，把虾放到锅中，开炸，小心爆锅，盖上盖子。","img":"images/661726/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炸到表皮变脆就出锅。","img":"images/661726/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"控油。","img":"images/661726/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/661726/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"虾头清理干净，虾头炸完很好吃的。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}